{"operations":[{"content":"def chunk(data, size):\n    \"\"\"Yield successive chunks from data of given size.\n\n    If size is larger than the length of data, yield one chunk containing all data.\n    The final chunk may be smaller than size if data length is not a multiple of size.\n\n    Args:\n        data (bytes or str): The input data to chunk.\n        size (int): The chunk size.\n\n    Yields:\n        chunks of data of length size, except possibly the last one.\n    \"\"\"\n    if size <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"size must be positive\")\n\n    length = len(data)\n    for start in range(0, length, size):\n        yield data[start:start + size]\n","expected_sha256":"7016a2b0dd284435e6f15970d4ba190d6386f23bccd03385aede97ee462ae675","kind":"modify","path":"src/chunking.py"}],"rationale":"Modified the chunk function to yield the final partial chunk when the data length is not a multiple of the chunk size, and to yield one chunk if the chunk size is larger than the input length, preserving the public API and existing tests."}